{"id":"d541ac78ed69cf9f","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-common-extension.md","title":"Common Extension","display":"df-common-extension — Common Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-common-extension","aliases":["93-df-common-extension"],"display":"df-common-extension — Common Extension","depends_on":["[[93-df-embedding]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-common-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-common-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-common-extension — Common Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\">\\(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\)</span> are algebra candidates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span> is the embedding predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CommonExt}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CommonExt}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}common\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\\mathrm{CommonExt}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists e_A\\;\\exists e_B\\;(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_A,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_B,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}common\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\\mathrm{CommonExt}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists e_A\\;\\exists e_B\\;(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_A,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_B,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All three algebras share one explicit similarity type; the signature is not hidden in an overloaded three-place shorthand.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ is the embedding predicate of [[93-df-embedding]] and $\\mathrm{CommonExt}_{93}$ is defined here.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CommonExt}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}common\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\\mathrm{CommonExt}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf C)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists e_A\\;\\exists e_B\\;(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_A,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(e_B,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[{"id":"e659db66dc4dd9b2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d611f4ac8b8895ab","6730349967b8ffce"]}